sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Lead as Lead Agent
  participant Planner
  participant OS as OpenSpec
  participant Rev as Reviewer
  participant App as Approver
  participant CMD as Command Facade
  participant WF as Workflow
  Lead->>CMD: create_plan_draft(task_id)
  CMD->>WF: 校验任务阶段与权限
  WF-->>CMD: phase=planning
  Lead->>Planner: 生成方案、用例与 oracle
  Planner->>OS: validate change / task contract
  OS-->>Planner: schema + traceability result
  Planner->>Rev: 请求跨模型家族评审
  Rev-->>Planner: findings + blockers
  opt 存在阻断项
    Planner->>Planner: 修订方案并重新评审
  end
  Planner->>App: 提交人工批准
  App-->>CMD: approve(plan_revision_sha256)
  CMD->>WF: freeze_plan + approval_id
  CMD->>OS: 记录批准与评审回执
  Note over CMD,WF: 批准后方案不可变；C1 证据由此生成
